{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Python 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Python 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\ns = input()\n# use a functional approach\nfrom functools import reduce\n\ndef replace_first_at(text):\n    idx = text.find('at')\n    if idx == -1:\n        return text\n    return text[:idx] + '@' + text[idx+2:]\n\ndef replace_all_dot(text):\n    return text.replace('dot', '.')\n\ndef handle_first(text):\n    if text and text[0] == '.':\n        return 'dot' + text[1:]\n    return text\n\ndef handle_first_at_and_prepend(text):\n    if text and text[0] == '@':\n        text = replace_first_at(text)\n        return 'at' + text[1:]\n    return text\n\ndef handle_last(text):\n    if text and text[-1] == '.':\n        return text[:-1] + 'dot'\n    return text\n\ns = handle_last(\n        handle_first_at_and_prepend(\n            handle_first(\n                replace_all_dot(\n                    replace_first_at(s)\n                )\n            )\n        )\n    )\nprint(s)\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        String s = scanner.nextLine();\n        scanner.close();\n\n        s = replaceFirstAt(s);\n        s = replaceAllDot(s);\n        s = handleFirst(s);\n        s = handleFirstAtAndPrepend(s);\n        s = handleLast(s);\n\n        System.out.println(s);\n    }\n\n    private static String replaceFirstAt(String text) {\n        int idx = text.indexOf(\"at\");\n        if (idx == -1) {\n            return text;\n        }\n        return text.substring(0, idx) + \"@\" + text.substring(idx + 2);\n    }\n\n    private static String replaceAllDot(String text) {\n        return text.replace(\"dot\", \".\");\n    }\n\n    private static String handleFirst(String text) {\n        if (text != null && !text.isEmpty() && text.charAt(0) == '.') {\n            return \"dot\" + text.substring(1);\n        }\n        return text;\n    }\n\n    private static String handleFirstAtAndPrepend(String text) {\n        if (text != null && !text.isEmpty() && text.charAt(0) == '@') {\n            text = replaceFirstAt(text);\n            return \"at\" + text.substring(1);\n        }\n        return text;\n    }\n\n    private static String handleLast(String text) {\n        if (text != null && !text.isEmpty() && text.charAt(text.length() - 1) == '.') {\n            return text.substring(0, text.length() - 1) + \"dot\";\n        }\n        return text;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.98\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00018952481332235038, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.823885577323381e-05, -5.960446742392378e-06, 0.0, -0.0005529781919904053, -0.006918640807271004, -0.0009135602158494294, -1.7881377516459906e-06, 0.0, -0.050347935408353806, -0.000553335587028414, -0.0001248043408850208, -0.0010118131758645177, 0.0, -0.014163801446557045, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.4305104514278355e-06, 0.0, -1.69275754160